Provenance

Workflow skills for Australian public-practice and contracting-business
accounting, written independently, from scratch, in my own time and on my own
equipment.


The v0.3.0 development expansion uses OpenAccountants Australian topic names
for gap identification. No OpenAccountants Guide bodies were copied or
adapted. The new workflow text is original; primary-source starting points
and their retrieval limitations are recorded beside each skill.

Additional intake and handoff gaps were identified by reviewing TaxMate
Australia (nijanthan-dev/taxmate-australia), tree
42ba67d458439e7882a3e8e0d76bfa6efdecbad7, on 6 October 2026. The new workflow
text is independently written for these skills. TaxMate runtime code,
generated source text, cached ATO material and tax tables were not copied.
The comparison and source licence are recorded in docs/taxmate-adoptions.md.

